<title>{{TITLE}} From Scratch</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
:root{
  --abyss:#0d2436;
  --deep:#12374f;
  --shelf:#2a6f8f;
  --shallow:#5ba3bd;
  --foam:#a8d4de;
  --sand:#f2f0eb;
  --paper:#faf9f6;
  --ink:#10222e;
  --ink-soft:#4a6270;
  --rule:#d5dee2;
  --amber:#c2701b;
  --amber-soft:#f5e4d0;
  --surface:var(--paper);
  --surface-2:var(--sand);
  --text:var(--ink);
  --text-soft:var(--ink-soft);
  --line:var(--rule);
  --accent:var(--deep);
  --accent-2:var(--shelf);
  --term-bg:#0d2436;
  --term-text:#cfe3ea;
  --term-dim:#6b93a6;
  --term-accent:#7fc4d8;
  --warn-bg:#fdf6ec;
  --warn-line:#e0b784;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
    --surface:#0a1a25;
    --surface-2:#102632;
    --text:#e2edf1;
    --text-soft:#93aeba;
    --line:#1e3c4d;
    --accent:#7fc4d8;
    --accent-2:#5ba3bd;
    --amber:#e0a058;
    --amber-soft:#2a2013;
    --term-bg:#061420;
    --term-text:#cfe3ea;
    --term-dim:#5d8195;
    --term-accent:#7fc4d8;
    --warn-bg:#231a0f;
    --warn-line:#6b4f26;
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --surface:#0a1a25;
  --surface-2:#102632;
  --text:#e2edf1;
  --text-soft:#93aeba;
  --line:#1e3c4d;
  --accent:#7fc4d8;
  --accent-2:#5ba3bd;
  --amber:#e0a058;
  --amber-soft:#2a2013;
  --term-bg:#061420;
  --term-text:#cfe3ea;
  --term-dim:#5d8195;
  --term-accent:#7fc4d8;
  --warn-bg:#231a0f;
  --warn-line:#6b4f26;
}

*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  background:var(--surface);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:"IBM Plex Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.6;
}
.wrap{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px 100px}

/* ---------- header ---------- */
header{
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:56px 0 32px;
  margin-bottom:44px;
}
.eyebrow{
  font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
  font-size:11px;
  letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--accent-2);
  margin:0 0 14px;
}
h1{
  font-family:"Fraunces",Georgia,serif;
  font-weight:600;
  font-size:clamp(34px,5.5vw,52px);
  line-height:1.08;
  margin:0 0 18px;
  text-wrap:balance;
  letter-spacing:-.015em;
}
.lede{
  font-size:17px;
  color:var(--text-soft);
  max-width:64ch;
  margin:0;
}
.lede strong{color:var(--text);font-weight:500}

/* ---------- sections ---------- */
h2{
  font-family:"Fraunces",Georgia,serif;
  font-weight:600;
  font-size:26px;
  margin:0 0 6px;
  letter-spacing:-.01em;
  text-wrap:balance;
}
.sec{margin-top:56px}
.sec-note{
  color:var(--text-soft);
  font-size:15px;
  max-width:66ch;
  margin:0 0 26px;
}

/* ---------- origin diagram ---------- */
.origin{
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:4px;
  padding:26px 24px 20px;
  margin-bottom:14px;
  overflow-x:auto;
}
.origin svg{display:block;min-width:640px;width:100%;height:auto}

/* ---------- steps ---------- */
.step{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;
  gap:20px;
  padding:26px 0;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
}
.step:last-of-type{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.num{
  font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--surface);
  background:var(--accent);
  width:30px;height:30px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  border-radius:50%;
  margin-top:2px;
}
.step[data-net="yes"] .num{background:var(--amber)}
.step h3{
  font-size:17px;
  font-weight:600;
  margin:0 0 4px;
  letter-spacing:-.005em;
}
.tags{
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;
  margin:0 0 12px;
}
.tag{
  font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
  font-size:10.5px;
  letter-spacing:.05em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:2px 8px;
  border-radius:2px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  color:var(--text-soft);
}
.tag.lvl{border-color:var(--accent-2);color:var(--accent-2)}
.tag.net{border-color:var(--amber);color:var(--amber)}
.step p{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--text-soft);font-size:15px;max-width:62ch}
.step p em{color:var(--text);font-style:normal;font-weight:500}

/* ---------- terminal ---------- */
.cmd{
  background:var(--term-bg);
  border-radius:4px;
  padding:13px 16px;
  overflow-x:auto;
  margin:0 0 10px;
}
.cmd code{
  font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
  font-size:13px;
  color:var(--term-text);
  white-space:pre;
  display:block;
}
.cmd .p{color:var(--term-dim);user-select:none}
.cmd .x{color:var(--term-accent)}
.out{
  font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--text-soft);
  border-left:2px solid var(--line);
  padding:2px 0 2px 13px;
  margin:0;
  white-space:pre-wrap;
}
.out b{color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:500}

/* ---------- callout ---------- */
.note{
  background:var(--warn-bg);
  border:1px solid var(--warn-line);
  border-left-width:3px;
  border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;
  padding:15px 18px;
  margin:14px 0 0;
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--text);
  max-width:66ch;
}
.note .lbl{
  font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
  font-size:10.5px;
  letter-spacing:.09em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--amber);
  display:block;
  margin-bottom:5px;
}

/* ---------- prep block ---------- */
.prep{
  background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:4px;
  padding:22px 24px;
}
.prep h3{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}
.prep p{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--text-soft);font-size:14.5px;max-width:62ch}

/* ---------- table ---------- */
.tbl-wrap{overflow-x:auto;margin-top:8px}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:440px;font-size:14px}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:9px 14px 9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
th{
  font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
  font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--text-soft);font-weight:500;
}
td.n{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
td.src{color:var(--text-soft)}

footer{
  margin-top:64px;padding-top:22px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-soft);
}
a{color:var(--accent-2)}
</style>

<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <p class="eyebrow">PTHA18 &middot; independent reproduction</p>
  <h1>{{TITLE}} From Scratch</h1>
  <p class="lede">Nine commands that build the seismic rate model for the {{TITLE}} subduction zone without starting from any saved result. <strong>Every input is either downloaded from a public source or derived by a rule written in the code.</strong></p>
</header>

<section class="sec" style="margin-top:0">
  <h2>Commands used for this folder</h2>
  <p class="sec-note" style="margin-bottom:10px">What was typed to make this folder and to run it, all from the repository root.</p>
  <p class="sec-note" style="margin-bottom:10px"><strong>1. Generate</strong>, which wrote this folder, its steps and this page:</p>
  <div class="cmd"><code><span class="p">$ </span>{{GENERATE_CMD}}</code></div>
  <p class="sec-note" style="margin-bottom:10px"><strong>2. Run all the steps at once.</strong> <code>step_total.py</code> adds a line below each time it finishes a run, with the flags it was given:</p>
  <!-- RUNS:BEGIN -->
  <!-- RUNS:END -->
  <p class="sec-note" style="margin-bottom:10px"><strong>Or run the steps one at a time</strong>, in this order (these are not recorded; step 7b makes the HS and VAUS slip fields, step 7c needs <code>--variable-mu on</code> at generation, step 8 needs R):</p>
  <div class="cmd"><code><span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step1_fetch_slab2.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step2_build_grid.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step3_convergence.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step4_fetch_gcmt.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step5_subset_gcmt.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step6_write_input.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step7_run.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step7b_stochastic_slip.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step7c_variable_mu.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step8_official.py
<span class="p">$ </span>python {{FOLDER}}/steps/step9_report.py</code></div>
</section>

